  "body": "Sometimes small parts of the standard are sorted out independently\nfirst, but generally we don’t mention those explicitly other than\nadding the folks involved to the Acknowledgments section.\n\nEspecially since this was contributed by Mozilla under CC0 (the listed\nlicense was never properly challenged until now), there’s no reason to\nlist this.\n\nFixes #2408.",
